      "role": "tool",
      "tool_call_id": "call_c7a5f6b9d9734916a5d76316",
      "name": "semantic_get",
      "content": "{\"ok\": true, \"entities\": [{\"id\": \"COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED\", \"name\": \"COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED\", \"desc\": \"Course catalog subject offering table recording catalog-level attributes of each subject offered per academic year and term: subject identity (SUBJECT_ID = SUBJECT_CODE.SUBJECT_NUMBER), department, unit structure (lecture/lab/preparation/design/total units), grading type and rules, HGN level (Undergraduate/Graduate/High Graduate), requirement attributes (GIR, HASS, communication, writing), term offering flags (this year, fall, IAP, spring, summer), instructors, section flags, responsible faculty, and meeting time/place. Links to terms via both TERM_CODE (the offering term) and EFFECTIVE_TERM_CODE (the term from which catalog attributes take effect).\", \"columns\": {\"ACADEMIC_YEAR\": {\"desc\": \"Academic year of the catalog offering, e.g. 2022\"}, \"TERM_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Term code of the offering record in YYYYTT format; joins to term tables\"}, \"SUBJECT_ID\": {\"desc\": \"Subject identifier formed as SUBJECT_CODE + '.' + SUBJECT_NUMBER, e.g. '18.01'; joins to TIP_DETAIL, LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED, SUBJECT_SUMMARY subject IDs\"}, \"SUBJECT_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Subject/course code prefix, e.g. '18' for Mathematics; joins to SIS_COURSE_DESCRIPTION.COURSE and SIS_SUBJECT_CODE.SUBJECT_CODE\"}, \"SUBJECT_NUMBER\": {\"desc\": \"Subject number within the subject code, e.g. '01'\"}, \"SOURCE_SUBJECT_ID\": {\"desc\": \"Source system subject identifier\"}, \"PRINT_SUBJECT_ID\": {\"desc\": \"Subject identifier as printed in the bulletin\"}, \"IS_PRINTED_IN_BULLETIN\": {\"desc\": \"'Y'/'N' flag whether the subject is printed in the bulletin\"}, \"DEPARTMENT_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Offering department code; joins to SIS_DEPARTMENT.DEPARTMENT_CODE\"}, \"DEPARTMENT_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Offering department name, e.g. 'Mathematics', 'Chemistry'\"}, \"EFFECTIVE_TERM_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Term code from which the catalog attributes of this subject take effect; frequently joined to ACADEMIC_TERMS.TERM_CODE for term-status filtering\"}, \"SUBJECT_SHORT_TITLE\": {\"desc\": \"Short title of the subject\"}, \"SUBJECT_TITLE\": {\"desc\": \"Full title of the subject\"}, \"IS_VARIABLE_UNITS\": {\"desc\": \"'Y'/'N' flag whether the subject has variable units\"}, \"LECTURE_UNITS\": {\"desc\": \"Number of lecture credit units\"}, \"LAB_UNITS\": {\"desc\": \"Number of lab credit units\"}, \"PREPARATION_UNITS\": {\"desc\": \"Number of preparation (outside-class) credit units\"}, \"TOTAL_UNITS\": {\"desc\": \"Total credit units of the subject (lecture+lab+preparation unless variable)\"}, \"DESIGN_UNITS\": {\"desc\": \"Number of design credit units\"}, \"GRADE_TYPE\": {\"desc\": \"Grade type code, e.g. 'L' = letter graded\"}, \"GRADE_TYPE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"Grade type description\"}, \"GRADE_RULE\": {\"desc\": \"Grade rule code\"}, \"GRADE_RULE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"Grade rule description, e.g. 'Not repeatable for credit'\"}, \"HGN_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"HGN (Higgins) level code\"}, \"HGN_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"HGN level description: 'Undergraduate', 'Graduate', or 'High Graduate'\"}, \"HGN_EXCEPT\": {\"desc\": \"HGN exception indicator\"}, \"GIR_ATTRIBUTE\": {\"desc\": \"General Institute Requirement attribute code\"}, \"GIR_ATTRIBUTE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"General Institute Requirement attribute description\"}, \"COMM_REQ_ATTRIBUTE\": {\"desc\": \"Communication requirement attribute code\"}, \"COMM_REQ_ATTRIBUTE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"Communication requirement attribute description\"}, \"TUITION_ATTRIBUTE\": {\"desc\": \"Tuition attribute code\"}, \"TUITION_ATTRIBUTE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"Tuition attribute description\"}, \"WRITE_REQ_ATTRIBUTE\": {\"desc\": \"Writing requirement attribute code\"}, \"WRITE_REQ_ATTRIBUTE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"Writing requirement attribute description\"}, \"SUPERVISOR_ATTRIBUTE\": {\"desc\": \"Supervisor attribute code\"}, \"SUPERVISOR_ATTRIBUTE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"Supervisor attribute description\"}, \"PREREQUISITES\": {\"desc\": \"Prerequisite text for the subject\"}, \"SUBJECT_DESCRIPTION\": {\"desc\": \"Full catalog description text of the subject\"}, \"JOINT_SUBJECTS\": {\"desc\": \"List of joint subjects\"}, \"SCHOOL_WIDE_ELECTIVES\": {\"desc\": \"School-wide elective attribute\"}, \"MEETS_WITH_SUBJECTS\": {\"desc\": \"Subjects this one meets with\"}, \"EQUIVALENT_SUBJECTS\": {\"desc\": \"Equivalent subjects\"}, \"IS_OFFERED_THIS_YEAR\": {\"desc\": \"'Y'/'N' flag whether the subject is offered in the current academic year\"}, \"IS_OFFERED_FALL_TERM\": {\"desc\": \"'Y'/'N' flag whether the subject is offered in the fall term\"}, \"IS_OFFERED_IAP\": {\"desc\": \"'Y'/'N' flag whether the subject is offered during IAP (January)\"}, \"IS_OFFERED_SPRING_TERM\": {\"desc\": \"'Y'/'N' flag whether the subject is offered in the spring term\"}, \"IS_OFFERED_SUMMER_TERM\": {\"desc\": \"'Y'/'N' flag whether the subject is offered in the summer term\"}, \"FALL_INSTRUCTORS\": {\"desc\": \"Fall term instructor names\"}, \"SPRING_INSTRUCTORS\": {\"desc\": \"Spring term instructor names\"}, \"STATUS_CHANGE\": {\"desc\": \"Catalog status change indicator\"}, \"LAST_ACTIVITY_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"Date of last activity on the record\"}, \"WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"ETL warehouse load date\"}, \"MASTER_SUBJECT_ID\": {\"desc\": \"Master subject identifier when the subject is part of a cluster\"}, \"HASS_ATTRIBUTE\": {\"desc\": \"HASS (Humanities, Arts, and Social Sciences) attribute code\"}, \"HASS_ATTRIBUTE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"HASS attribute description\"}, \"TERM_DURATION\": {\"desc\": \"Duration of the subject within the term\"}, \"GLOBAL_REGIONS\": {\"desc\": \"Global regions associated with the subject\"}, \"GLOBAL_COUNTRIES\": {\"desc\": \"Global countries associated with the subject\"}, \"ON_LINE_PAGE_NUMBER\": {\"desc\": \"Online catalog page number\"}, \"SECTION_ID\": {\"desc\": \"Section identifier of the subject offering\"}, \"IS_MASTER_SECTION\": {\"desc\": \"'Y'/'N' flag for master section\"}, \"IS_LECTURE_SECTION\": {\"desc\": \"'Y'/'N' flag for lecture section\"}, \"IS_LAB_SECTION\": {\"desc\": \"'Y'/'N' flag for lab section\"}, \"IS_RECITATION_SECTION\": {\"desc\": \"'Y'/'N' flag for recitation section\"}, \"IS_DESIGN_SECTION\": {\"desc\": \"'Y'/'N' flag for design section\"}, \"RESPONSIBLE_FACULTY_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Name of the faculty member responsible for the subject\"}, \"RESPONSIBLE_FACULTY_MIT_ID\": {\"desc\": \"MIT ID of the responsible faculty member\"}, \"MEET_TIME\": {\"desc\": \"Meeting time text of the subject\"}, \"MEET_PLACE\": {\"desc\": \"Meeting place; stores the FCLT room key and joins to FCLT_ROOMS.FCLT_ROOM_KEY for facility/space analysis\"}}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per subject offering per term/academic year\"}, {\"id\": \"ACADEMIC_TERMS\", \"name\": \"ACADEMIC_TERMS\", \"desc\": \"Academic term dimension table describing each academic term's calendar and status attributes: term code/description, start/end dates, academic year, financial aid year, degree year, key registration and class dates, and term status classification (Previous/Current/Future, regular vs non-regular term). Used to filter and enrich subject offerings by term characteristics.\", \"columns\": {\"ACADEMIC_TERMS_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Surrogate key of the academic term record; joins to ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL.ACADEMIC_TERMS_KEY\"}, \"TERM_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Term code in YYYYTT format, e.g. '2025FA' (FA=Fall, SP=Spring, JA=January/IAP, SU=Summer)\"}, \"TERM_DESCRIPTION\": {\"desc\": \"Human-readable term description, e.g. 'Fall Term 2024-2025'\"}, \"TERM_SELECTOR\": {\"desc\": \"Term selector label used for picklists\"}, \"TERM_START_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"Term start date; can match TIME_DAY.CALENDAR_DATE for calendar-based joins\"}, \"TERM_END_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"Term end date\"}, \"ACADEMIC_YEAR\": {\"desc\": \"Academic year the term belongs to, e.g. 2025\"}, \"ACADEMIC_YEAR_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"Academic year description text\"}, \"IS_CURRENT_TERM\": {\"desc\": \"'Y'/'N' flag indicating whether the term is the current term\"}, \"IS_REGULAR_TERM\": {\"desc\": \"'Y'/'N' flag indicating a regular term (Fall/Spring) versus non-regular terms (Summer, January/IAP); only present in ACADEMIC_TERMS, not in ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL\"}, \"TERM_STATUS_INDICATOR\": {\"desc\": \"Single-character term status indicator: 'P'=Previous, 'C'=Current, 'F'=Future, 'None'=Unspecified\"}, \"TERM_STATUS\": {\"desc\": \"Term status text: 'Previous', 'Current', 'Future', or 'Unspecified'\"}, \"FINANCIAL_AID_YEAR\": {\"desc\": \"Financial aid year the term maps to\"}, \"DEGREE_YEAR\": {\"desc\": \"Degree year the term maps to; used in degree-year statistics\"}, \"LAST_DAY_OF_FINAL_EXAM\": {\"desc\": \"Last day of final exams for the term\"}, \"PRE_REGISTRATION_START_DAY\": {\"desc\": \"First day of pre-registration for the term\"}, \"REGISTRATION_DAY\": {\"desc\": \"Registration day for the term\"}, \"FIRST_DAY_OF_CLASSES\": {\"desc\": \"First day of classes in the term\"}, \"LAST_DAY_OF_CLASSES\": {\"desc\": \"Last day of classes in the term\"}, \"ADD_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"Last day to add a subject in the term; only present in ACADEMIC_TERMS\"}, \"DROP_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"Last day to drop a subject in the term; only present in ACADEMIC_TERMS\"}, \"GRADUATE_AWARD_START_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"Start date of the graduate award period for the term\"}, \"GRADUATE_AWARD_END_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"End date of the graduate award period for the term\"}, \"WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"ETL warehouse load date of the record\"}}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per academic term\"}, {\"id\": \"SUBJECT_SUMMARY\", \"name\": \"SUBJECT_SUMMARY\", \"desc\": \"Subject-level summary fact table per term: one row per subject (or cluster) per term with department/school attribution, unit structure (total/lecture/lab/prep/design units), and detailed enrollment statistics including final enrollment, first-week and fifth-week enrollment, and credit/listener splits at both subject and cluster level. Used for enrollment and unit statistics by department, school, term, and subject group.\", \"columns\": {\"SUBJECT_SUMMARY_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Surrogate key of the subject summary record\"}, \"TERM_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Term code in YYYYTT format; joins to ACADEMIC_TERMS/ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL\"}, \"SUBJECT_ID\": {\"desc\": \"Subject identifier, e.g. '18.01'; joins to TIP_DETAIL, LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED, COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED subject IDs\"}, \"SUBJECT_ID_SORT\": {\"desc\": \"Sortable form of the subject identifier\"}, \"SUBJECT_TITLE\": {\"desc\": \"Subject title\"}, \"SUBJECT_OR_CLUSTER\": {\"desc\": \"Indicator whether the row represents a subject or a cluster\"}, \"MASTER_SUBJECT_ID\": {\"desc\": \"Master subject identifier for clustered subjects\"}, \"MASTER_SUBJECT_ID_SORT\": {\"desc\": \"Sortable form of the master subject identifier\"}, \"ULT_MASTER_SUBJECT_ID\": {\"desc\": \"Ultimate master subject identifier in cluster hierarchies\"}, \"CLUSTER_TYPE\": {\"desc\": \"Cluster type code\"}, \"CLUSTER_TYPE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"Cluster type description\"}, \"CLUSTER_LIST\": {\"desc\": \"List of subjects in the cluster\"}, \"DEPARTMENT_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Department code; joins to SIS_DEPARTMENT.DEPARTMENT_CODE\"}, \"DEPARTMENT_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Department name, e.g. 'Mathematics'\"}, \"SCHOOL_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"School code, e.g. 'E' for Engineering\"}, \"SCHOOL_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"School name, e.g. 'Engineering'\"}, \"TOTAL_UNITS\": {\"desc\": \"Total credit units of the subject\"}, \"LECTURE_UNITS\": {\"desc\": \"Lecture credit units\"}, \"LAB_UNITS\": {\"desc\": \"Lab credit units\"}, \"PREP_UNITS\": {\"desc\": \"Preparation credit units (named PREP_UNITS here vs PREPARATION_UNITS in other tables)\"}, \"DESIGN_UNITS\": {\"desc\": \"Design credit units\"}, \"SUBJECT_ENROLLMENT_NUMBER\": {\"desc\": \"Final enrollment number of the subject\"}, \"CLUSTER_ENROLLMENT_NUMBER\": {\"desc\": \"Final enrollment number of the cluster\"}, \"SUBJECT_GROUP_ID\": {\"desc\": \"Subject group identifier used for grouping related subjects\"}, \"SUBJECT_ENROLLMENT_FIRST_WEEK\": {\"desc\": \"Subject enrollment in the first week\"}, \"CLUSTER_ENROLLMENT_FIRST_WEEK\": {\"desc\": \"Cluster enrollment in the first week\"}, \"SUBJECT_ENROLLMENT_FIFTH_WEEK\": {\"desc\": \"Subject enrollment in the fifth week\"}, \"CLUSTER_ENROLLMENT_FIFTH_WEEK\": {\"desc\": \"Cluster enrollment in the fifth week\"}, \"SUBJECT_ENROLLMENT_CREDIT\": {\"desc\": \"Number of students enrolled in the subject for credit\"}, \"SUBJECT_ENROLLMENT_LISTEN\": {\"desc\": \"Number of listeners enrolled in the subject\"}, \"CLUSTER_ENROLLMENT_CREDIT\": {\"desc\": \"Number of students enrolled in the cluster for credit\"}, \"CLUSTER_ENROLLMENT_LISTEN\": {\"desc\": \"Number of listeners enrolled in the cluster\"}, \"SUBJECT_ENROLLMENT_1ST_CREDIT\": {\"desc\": \"First-year/first-level credit enrollment of the subject\"}, \"SUBJECT_ENROLLMENT_1ST_LISTEN\": {\"desc\": \"First-year/first-level listener enrollment of the subject\"}, \"CLUSTER_ENROLLMENT_1ST_CREDIT\": {\"desc\": \"First-year/first-level credit enrollment of the cluster\"}, \"CLUSTER_ENROLLMENT_1ST_LISTEN\": {\"desc\": \"First-year/first-level listener enrollment of the cluster\"}, \"SUBJECT_ENROLLMENT_5TH_CREDIT\": {\"desc\": \"Fifth-year/level credit enrollment of the subject\"}, \"SUBJECT_ENROLLMENT_5TH_LISTEN\": {\"desc\": \"Fifth-year/level listener enrollment of the subject\"}, \"CLUSTER_ENROLLMENT_5TH_CREDIT\": {\"desc\": \"Fifth-year/level credit enrollment of the cluster\"}, \"CLUSTER_ENROLLMENT_5TH_LISTEN\": {\"desc\": \"Fifth-year/level listener enrollment of the cluster\"}, \"WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"ETL warehouse load date\"}}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per subject per term\"}, {\"id\": \"SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY\", \"name\": \"SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY\", \"desc\": \"Subject-level rollup of section offerings per term: one row per subject offered in a term with unit structure (total/lecture/lab/preparation units), offering department and school, responsible faculty, cluster information, and enrollment numbers. Parent of SUBJECT_OFFERED (section level) via COMPOSITE_SUBJECT_KEY / SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY_KEY.\", \"columns\": {\"SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Surrogate key of the subject offered summary record\"}, \"COMPOSITE_SUBJECT_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Composite subject key; joins to SUBJECT_OFFERED.COMPOSITE_SUBJECT_KEY\"}, \"TERM_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Term code in YYYYTT format; joins to ACADEMIC_TERMS/ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL\"}, \"COURSE_NUMBER\": {\"desc\": \"Course number of the subject; joins to SIS_SUBJECT_CODE.COURSE_NUMBER and SIS_COURSE_DESCRIPTION.COURSE\"}, \"SUBJECT_ID\": {\"desc\": \"Subject identifier, e.g. '18.01'; joins to TIP_DETAIL.SUBJECT_ID and LIBRARY_SUBJECT_OFFERED.SUBJECT_ID\"}, \"SUBJECT_ID_SORT\": {\"desc\": \"Sortable form of the subject identifier\"}, \"SUBJECT_TITLE\": {\"desc\": \"Subject title\"}, \"MASTER_SUBJECT_ID\": {\"desc\": \"Master subject identifier for clustered subjects\"}, \"MASTER_SUBJECT_ID_SORT\": {\"desc\": \"Sortable form of the master subject identifier\"}, \"CLUSTER_TYPE\": {\"desc\": \"Cluster type code\"}, \"CLUSTER_TYPE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"Cluster type description\"}, \"CLUSTER_LIST\": {\"desc\": \"List of subjects in the cluster\"}, \"HGN_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"HGN (Higgins) level code\"}, \"HGN_CODE_DESC\": {\"desc\": \"HGN level description\"}, \"OFFER_DEPT_CODE\": {\"desc\": \"Offering department code; joins to SIS_DEPARTMENT.DEPARTMENT_CODE\"}, \"OFFER_DEPT_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Offering department name\"}, \"OFFER_SCHOOL_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Offering school name, e.g. 'Engineering'; used for school-level filtering\"}, \"RESPONSIBLE_FACULTY_NAME\": {\"desc\": \"Name of the faculty member responsible for the subject\"}, \"RESPONSIBLE_FACULTY_MIT_ID\": {\"desc\": \"MIT ID of the responsible faculty member\"}, \"TOTAL_UNITS\": {\"desc\": \"Total credit units of the subject\"}, \"LECTURE_UNITS\": {\"desc\": \"Lecture credit units\"}, \"LAB_UNITS\": {\"desc\": \"Lab credit units\"}, \"PREPARATION_UNITS\": {\"desc\": \"Preparation credit units\"}, \"SUBJECT_ENROLLMENT_NUMBER\": {\"desc\": \"Enrollment number at the subject level\"}, \"CLUSTER_ENROLLMENT_NUMBER\": {\"desc\": \"Enrollment number of the cluster\"}, \"WAREHOUSE_LOAD_DATE\": {\"desc\": \"ETL warehouse load date\"}, \"NUM_ENROLLED_STUDENTS\": {\"desc\": \"Number of students enrolled in the subject\"}, \"SUBJECT_GROUPING_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Key to the subject grouping record\"}, \"SUBJECT_SUMMARY_KEY\": {\"desc\": \"Foreign key to SUBJECT_SUMMARY.SUBJECT_SUMMARY_KEY\"}}, \"default_granularity\": \"one row per subject per term\"}, {\"columns\": [\"COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.TOTAL_UNITS\", \"SUBJECT_SUMMARY.TOTAL_UNITS\", \"SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY.TOTAL_UNITS\", \"CIS_COURSE_CATALOG.TOTAL_UNITS\", \"DRUPAL_COURSE_CATALOG.TOTAL_UNITS\"], \"comparisons\": [{\"dimension\": \"Source process\", \"detail\": \"COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.TOTAL_UNITS is the catalog-declared unit value per offering; SUBJECT_SUMMARY.TOTAL_UNITS and SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY.TOTAL_UNITS are registrar subject-level values; CIS/DRUPAL catalog feeds carry their own copies\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Companion unit columns\", \"detail\": \"All these tables also expose LECTURE_UNITS, LAB_UNITS, and preparation units (PREPARATION_UNITS except SUBJECT_SUMMARY which uses PREP_UNITS); DESIGN_UNITS exists in COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED, SUBJECT_SUMMARY, CIS and DRUPAL catalogs but not in SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Variability flag\", \"detail\": \"COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.IS_VARIABLE_UNITS marks subjects whose units vary; analyses of fixed-unit statistics typically filter IS_VARIABLE_UNITS='N'\"}], \"decision_guide\": {\"Unit statistics (avg/stddev/variance/geometric mean) over catalog offerings, optionally split by lecture/lab/design or filtered by variable-units flag\": \"Use COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.TOTAL_UNITS with its companion unit columns.\", \"Unit statistics tied to actual enrollment records or subject groups per term\": \"Use SUBJECT_SUMMARY.TOTAL_UNITS.\", \"Unit statistics at subject-offering rollup level with offering department/school\": \"Use SUBJECT_OFFERED_SUMMARY.TOTAL_UNITS.\", \"Fixed-unit analyses excluding variable-unit subjects\": \"Filter COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.IS_VARIABLE_UNITS = 'N'.\"}, \"desc\": \"Total credit unit columns replicated across catalog and registrar subject tables. They represent the same business quantity (total credit units of a subject) but come from different processes and pair with different companion unit columns.\", \"id\": \"column_concept_total_units\", \"name\": \"Total Credit Units\"}, {\"columns\": [\"ACADEMIC_TERMS.ACADEMIC_YEAR\", \"ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL.ACADEMIC_YEAR\", \"COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.ACADEMIC_YEAR\", \"TIME_DAY.ACADEMIC_YEAR\", \"TIME_DAY.FISCAL_YEAR\", \"TIME_DAY.CALENDAR_YEAR\", \"TIME_MONTH.ACADEMIC_YEAR\", \"TIME_MONTH.FISCAL_YEAR\", \"TIME_MONTH.CALENDAR_YEAR\", \"TIME_MONTH.FINANCIAL_AID_YEAR\", \"TIME_QUARTER.FISCAL_YEAR\", \"TIME_QUARTER.CALENDAR_YEAR\", \"ACADEMIC_TERMS.FINANCIAL_AID_YEAR\", \"ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL.FINANCIAL_AID_YEAR\", \"ACADEMIC_TERMS.DEGREE_YEAR\"], \"comparisons\": [{\"dimension\": \"Year system\", \"detail\": \"ACADEMIC_YEAR is the academic year a term/offering/date belongs to; FISCAL_YEAR is the institute fiscal year (MIT fiscal year starts in July, so a fiscal year spans two calendar years); CALENDAR_YEAR is the natural calendar year; FINANCIAL_AID_YEAR is the aid year a term/month maps to; DEGREE_YEAR is the degree-conferral year a term maps to. These year systems do not always coincide for the same term or date.\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Location\", \"detail\": \"Term tables (ACADEMIC_TERMS/ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL) carry academic/financial-aid/degree years per term; COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED carries its own ACADEMIC_YEAR per catalog record; the time dimension tables carry year systems at their own granularity: TIME_DAY (fiscal/calendar/academic year per day), TIME_MONTH (fiscal/calendar/academic/aid year per month), TIME_QUARTER (fiscal/calendar year per quarter, no academic year).\"}, {\"dimension\": \"Grouping behavior\", \"detail\": \"Grouping offerings by catalog ACADEMIC_YEAR vs joining to term tables' ACADEMIC_YEAR can yield different groupings when a catalog record's TERM_CODE and ACADEMIC_YEAR disagree; grouping time-dimension rows by FISCAL_YEAR vs CALENDAR_YEAR yields different period assignments for dates between January and June.\"}], \"decision_guide\": {\"Yearly statistics over subject offerings\": \"Group by COURSE_CATALOG_SUBJECT_OFFERED.ACADEMIC_YEAR when the question says 'academic year YYYY' for offerings; join term tables for term-status filters.\", \"Yearly statistics over terms themselves (e.g. degree year geometric means, financial aid year partitions)\": \"Use ACADEMIC_TERMS / ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL year columns (DEGREE_YEAR, FINANCIAL_AID_YEAR).\", \"Matching IAP activity dates to academic years via calendar\": \"Use TIME_DAY.FISCAL_YEAR or TIME_DAY.ACADEMIC_YEAR through TERM_CODE = ACADEMIC_TERM_CODE.\", \"Windowed running sums partitioned by aid year\": \"Use ACADEMIC_TERMS_ALL.FINANCIAL_AID_YEAR as the partition key.\", \"Fiscal-year or calendar-month statistics over months/days\": \"Use TIME_MONTH.FISCAL_YEAR / TIME_MONTH.CALENDAR_YEAR (month grain) or TIME_DAY.CALENDAR_YEAR (day grain), joined on FISCAL_PERIOD when both grains are needed.\"}, \"desc\": \"Year columns across term, catalog, and time dimension tables representing different year systems: academic year, fiscal year, financial aid year, and degree year. Selecting the correct year system is essential for yearly grouping and partitioning.\", \"id\": \"column_concept_year_columns\", \"name\": \"Academic and Fiscal Year Columns\"}], \"not_found\": []}"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
